        "line_end": 520
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0387",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "说明客户核心需求、业务应用价值、典型使用方式、需求来源、客户采购条件、前期对接和交付责任、续约责任及市场推广支持安排。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件二　产品及场景服务说明要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0222",
        "line_start": 520,
        "line_end": 520
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0388",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "十二是试用与异常处置信息。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件二　产品及场景服务说明要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0223",
        "line_start": 522,
        "line_end": 522
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0389",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "说明样例、试用或者验证安排，试用范围和期限，折扣和优惠条件，以及调用失败、交付延误、退款、服务补偿和客户投诉的处理原则。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件二　产品及场景服务说明要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0223",
        "line_start": 522,
        "line_end": 522
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0390",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "合作事项进入实施方案编制和试点前，原则上开展成熟度评估，由合作各方共同确认需求、资源、权利、质量、技术、安全、商务和持续运营条件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0224",
        "line_start": 526,
        "line_end": 526
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0391",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "依法应当履行的审批、评估或者备案程序按有关规定执行。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0224",
        "line_start": 526,
        "line_end": 526
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0392",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "一是需求真实性。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0225",
        "line_start": 528,
        "line_end": 528
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0393",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否具有明确需求单位、业务负责人、使用对象和应用问题，是否能够说明现有方式的不足、预期成果和使用频次。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0225",
        "line_start": 528,
        "line_end": 528
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0394",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "二是资源可用性。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0226",
        "line_start": 530,
        "line_end": 530
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0395",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否已经明确所需数据、知识、模型、专家和技术能力，资源是否可以持续提供，是否具备样例和技术验证条件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0226",
        "line_start": 530,
        "line_end": 530
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0396",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "三是权利清晰度。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0227",
        "line_start": 532,
        "line_end": 532
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0397",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否能够说明资源来源、权利主体、授权依据、第三方权利、允许用途、客户范围和二次使用条件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0227",
        "line_start": 532,
        "line_end": 532
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0398",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "四是质量成熟度。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0228",
        "line_start": 534,
        "line_end": 534
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0399",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否具备数据口径、质量检测、模型性能、版本更新、适用条件和问题整改机制，是否存在影响交付的重大质量缺陷。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0228",
        "line_start": 534,
        "line_end": 534
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0400",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "五是技术可行性。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0229",
        "line_start": 536,
        "line_end": 536
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0401",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否明确接入方式、部署环境、计算资源、接口适配、系统集成、性能容量和运维条件，是否具备稳定交付的技术基础。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0229",
        "line_start": 536,
        "line_end": 536
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0402",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "六是安全合规性。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0230",
        "line_start": 538,
        "line_end": 538
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0403",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否完成数据分类分级和风险初判，是否明确数据留域、访问控制、输出限制、日志审计、个人信息保护和安全事件处置要求。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0230",
        "line_start": 538,
        "line_end": 538
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0404",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "七是商业可行性。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0231",
        "line_start": 540,
        "line_end": 540
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0405",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否存在明确采购主体和采购路径，客户是否具有初步价格接受度，客户报价构成、计量单位、直接成本、平台运营收入、合作伙伴结算、预计毛利和回款安排是否具备测算基础。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0231",
        "line_start": 540,
        "line_end": 540
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0406",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "八是持续运营能力。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0232",
        "line_start": 542,
        "line_end": 542
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0407",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否明确数据更新、接口维护、模型升级、客户支持、运营人员和费用来源，合作各方是否能够长期履行服务责任。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0232",
        "line_start": 542,
        "line_end": 542
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0408",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "九是复制推广价值。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0233",
        "line_start": 544,
        "line_end": 544
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0409",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "是否具有行业共性需求，产品和场景能否形成标准规格、配置参数、接口规范、实施清单和典型案例。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0233",
        "line_start": 544,
        "line_end": 544
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0410",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "十是综合评估结论。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0234",
        "line_start": 546,
        "line_end": 546
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0411",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "根据上述条件形成优先推进、补充条件后推进、继续储备或者暂不推进的结论，并明确缺口、责任人和计划完成时间。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件三　合作事项成熟度评估要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0234",
        "line_start": 546,
        "line_end": 546
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0412",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "试点重点验证产品或者场景的客户价值、技术路径、安全边界和持续运营条件，并控制实施范围、明确各方责任、完整保留过程证据。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件四　试点实施与验收要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0235",
        "line_start": 550,
        "line_end": 550
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0413",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "一是试点基本信息。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件四　试点实施与验收要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0236",
        "line_start": 552,
        "line_end": 552
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0414",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "明确试点名称、需求单位、参与主体、业务负责人、实施周期、试点范围、预期成果和决策机制。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件四　试点实施与验收要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0236",
        "line_start": 552,
        "line_end": 552
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0415",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "二是试点资源范围。",
      "heading_path": [
        "附件四　试点实施与验收要点"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
